cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this software, please cite it as below."
title: "agent-toolkit: open-source developer tools for AI agents and business automations"
abstract: >-
  agent-toolkit is a collection of small, browser-safe TypeScript tools for people building
  AI agents and business automations: workflow-lint (a preflight linter for n8n and generic
  workflow definitions), webhook-inspect (webhook signature verification, explanation and
  failure diagnosis for Stripe, GitHub, Shopify, Slack, Twilio and generic HMAC), and
  permission-planner (minimum OAuth scopes, risk tiers and human-approval policies for
  agent actions, with every scope traced to official documentation).
type: software
authors:
  - name: "TeamShift"
    website: "https://teamshift.io"
repository-code: "https://github.com/teamshift-io/agent-toolkit"
url: "https://teamshift.io/open-source/agent-toolkit"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-03"
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - automation
  - n8n
  - linter
  - webhooks
  - signature-verification
  - oauth-scopes
  - least-privilege
  - human-in-the-loop
